SCOPE NOTES (read DATA_NOTICE.md before publishing this repository):

1. This license covers the original DOPEY source code (dopey_* packages,
   operator_tools, tests, and reports authored in this repository).
2. It does NOT cover directories vendored or forked from other projects
   (_forked_blunder, _forked_blunder_tests, _forked_scripts), which remain
   under their own upstream licenses.
3. It does NOT cover market data under dopey_data/ (see DATA_NOTICE.md).
   Market data fetched from public providers is for personal/internal
   research use and must not be redistributed with this repository.
4. Nothing in this repository is investment advice. The software is a
   paper-only research harness whose own truth layer currently reports NO
   demonstrated trading edge. Live trading is disabled by design.
